(AMENDMENT No. 1 TO MASTER SUPPLY AGREEMENT MSA-SUP-104) '
(Between Contoso Manufacturing Holdings \("Buyer"\) and INITECH PARTS \("Supplier"\), Supplier ID) '
(SUP-104.) '
(Amendment Effective Date: 2025-09-15.) '
() '
(The parties agree to amend the Agreement as follows:) '
(A. Section 7.1 is deleted and replaced with: "Buyer may claim liquidated damages equal to 4.0%) '
(of Financial Exposure for the contract year.") '
(B. Section 8.1 is deleted and replaced with: "Aggregate liquidated damages under Section 7) '
(shall not exceed USD 180,000 per contract year.") '
(C. This Amendment applies to all claims assessed after the Amendment Effective Date, including) '
(deliveries made from 1 January 2025.) '
(D. All other terms of the Agreement remain unchanged. In case of conflict, this Amendment) '
(prevails.) '
() '
